estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: zsh and fish complete every pm docs flag that bash completes; A spec compares each shell's files and docs completion flags with FILES_FLAG_CONTRACTS and DOCS_FLAG_CONTRACTS so the next drift fails
